  "description": "One actual cosine trace from x=0 to pi and its descending tangent y=pi/2-x, contacting at (pi/2,0), slope -1. Source labels 0/x/y/1/-1/pi/2/pi retained; no visible contact/endpoint dot, no extra period, equation label, slope label, guides or answer annotations. Sampling and spacing are modern rendering regularizations.",
